<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Trift Bridge from the road — Nessental Triftbahn–Trift Bridge–return</name><desc>Start at the Triftbahn lower station in Schwendi, walk to the former upper-station area, continue to and across Trift Bridge, then return by the same path. The cableway has no service in 2026; this is a long mountain day.

